{"id":1120301,"chapter_id":1120301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"通过门上的玻璃挡板，你看到了审查室内的少女。","style":3,"log_type":2,"src_id":220301002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1120301},{"step":2,"content":"她安安静静地坐在那里，眼中没有透出一丝一毫的温度。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1120301},{"step":3,"content":"你摸了摸身上厚厚的防护服，看了眼审查室内密密麻麻的监测设备，确认无虞之后，推开门，打开了灯。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1120301},{"step":4,"content":"你好，帕加茜。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":5,"content":"帕加茜微微抬头，白皙的脸上只有冷漠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1120301},{"step":6,"content":"MBCC和环研究院之间达成了协议，将你转移到了这里。今后，你将作为MBCC收容下的禁闭者生活于此。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1120301},{"step":7,"content":"当然，鉴于你今后都要生活在管理局，有一些重要的安全事宜我必须同你确认。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1120301},{"step":8,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我明白。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1120302},{"step":9,"content":"帕加茜的声音平静而冷冽。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1120302},{"step":10,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"请开始审查吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1120301},{"step":11,"content":"你瞥了一眼墙上的核探测元件。那台由环研究院提供的老旧仪器几乎没有什么动静，屏幕上的数字在0.3-0.5之间来回跳动——这意味着截止目前，你还是安全的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1120301},{"step":12,"content":"你拿起手中的资料，拆开标有核辐射警告标志的文档袋，脑子里都是今天早些时候与夜莺的那段谈话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1120301},{"step":13,"content":"办公桌旁，夜莺正紧锁着眉头。看到你进来，她放下手中的文件站了起来。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1120301},{"step":14,"content":"环研究院将帕加茜移交过来后，MBCC一直在积极准备着帕加茜的收容措施。副官夜莺则趁着这段时间整理了相关资料。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1120301},{"step":15,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"这些是原文描述。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1120301},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"“虽然对象没有表现出过攻击意图，但只要长期待在同一地点，辐射量就会持续累加。”","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1120301},{"step":17,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"“对象出现情绪波动时，辐射量会异常提高，最高可至1986.4伦琴。”","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1120301},{"step":18,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"“在对象身上切下的组织会持续散发强烈辐射，无害化处理成本极高。”","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1120301},{"step":19,"content":"她不是狄斯城的禁闭者吧？为什么会有这么危险的能力？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1120301},{"step":20,"content":"夜莺摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1120301},{"step":21,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"档案上没有明说。只知道8年前，环研究院监测到狄斯城以北两千公里的地方，出现了异常的能量反应。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1120301},{"step":22,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"资料显示，那里有一座废弃核电站。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1120301},{"step":23,"content":"核电站？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1120301},{"step":24,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"一种旧时代的能源设施，使用着本已被城邦联合销毁封存的技术——同样，拥有毁灭性的力量。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1120301},{"step":25,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……救援队到达时，那里的人类聚居地——马耶克镇已被夷为平地。帕加茜是唯一的幸存者。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1120301},{"step":26,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"有研究员怀疑帕加茜是核事故的罪魁祸首，但没有实际证据。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1120301},{"step":27,"content":"他们没有问过帕加茜吗？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1120301},{"step":28,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"没有相关资料。研究院毕竟没有专业的审查部门，也不会做自己职责以外的事情。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1120301},{"step":29,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"事实上，也就是头两年他们研究过帕加茜的能力，之后的几年帕加茜一直被关在防辐射隔离间里。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1120301},{"step":30,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"研究院并不在意这个失去研究价值的禁闭者，也没有义务搞清楚当初马耶克镇的真相。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1120301},{"step":31,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"他们只是把帕加茜当做一个麻烦丢给了管理局。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1120301},{"step":32,"content":"如今，这个“麻烦”，导致马耶克覆灭的嫌疑凶手正坐在你面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1120301},{"step":33,"content":"你没有浪费时间，翻开档案，正式开始了审问。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1120301},{"step":34,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":35,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":36,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":37,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":38,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":39,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":40,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":41,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":42,"options":["询问帕加茜的能力"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301037,"trial_step":37,"course":3,"drawing":1120301,"choices":[{"text":"询问帕加茜的能力","goto":38}]},{"step":43,"content":"聊聊你的能力吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1120301},{"step":44,"content":"帕加茜注视着你的眼睛，开口回答道——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1120301},{"step":45,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"最大半径约100米、最高辐射量2000伦琴左右的辐射场。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1120301},{"step":46,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"可以凭主观意愿发动，也会在外界刺激下被动释放。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1120301},{"step":47,"content":"看来你很了解自己的能力。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1120301},{"step":48,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"他们研究的时候说过，我只是记住了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1120302},{"step":49,"content":"她的声音很平静，身体也保持着最初的姿势。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1120301},{"step":50,"content":"你现在感觉怎么样？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1120301},{"step":51,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"很好。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1120301},{"step":52,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"不用吃饭，不用休息，力量和耐力都提升了许多，辐射也不会影响自身。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1120301},{"step":53,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我很好。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1120302},{"step":54,"options":["没有负面影响吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301049,"trial_step":49,"course":3,"drawing":1120301,"choices":[{"text":"没有负面影响吗？","goto":50}]},{"step":55,"content":"帕加茜摇摇头，眼神却不自觉地瞥向自己的机械义肢。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1120303},{"step":56,"content":"手臂会痛吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1120303},{"step":57,"content":"泛着深色金属光泽的外涂装与眼前的少女显得格格不入。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1120303},{"step":58,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"……嗯。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1120303},{"step":59,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"与义肢连接的神经末梢会痛。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1120303},{"step":60,"content":"这个义肢是环研究院的人给你装的么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1120303},{"step":61,"content":"你有些好奇。毕竟这种精度的仿生装置，在狄斯城都不多见。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1120303},{"step":62,"content":"如果帕加茜是在偏远的小镇、获得禁闭者能力之前失去的手臂，想必会给她的生活带来许多不便。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1120303,"next":[58]},{"step":63,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"他们加装了仿生纤维，里面的金属骨骼是在镇上安装的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1120302},{"step":64,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"时间太久，与神经相连，已经无法更换了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1120301},{"step":65,"content":"那是爆炸……你成为禁闭者之前发生的事？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1120301},{"step":66,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"是的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1120301},{"step":67,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"修理管道的时候，出了事故。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1120301},{"step":68,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"接上义肢之后很快就习惯了，疼痛也可以忍受，不会影响工作。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1120301},{"step":69,"content":"失去手臂之后还要工作？都要做些什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1120302},{"step":70,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"和之前没什么不同。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1120301},{"step":71,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"每周三次检修核电站管道、给田地除草、帮镇长处理和派送文件。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1120301},{"step":72,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"就只是这些。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1120301},{"step":73,"content":"这样的工作对一个……对你来说未免太沉重了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1120301},{"step":74,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"局长。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1120304},{"step":75,"content":"帕加茜深深看着你，言语里似乎多了些情绪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1120304},{"step":76,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"狄斯城和我们不一样，和这个世界上绝大多数地方都不一样。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1120304},{"step":77,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"狄斯城有充沛的能源，有异方晶可以抵御天灾。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1120304},{"step":78,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"马耶克镇没有……我们养不起闲人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1120304},{"step":79,"content":"……抱歉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1120301},{"step":80,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我没有责怪您的意思。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1120303},{"step":81,"content":"我知道，但我必须道歉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1120303},{"step":82,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1120301},{"step":83,"content":"帕加茜没有再说什么，气氛再次变得平静起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1120301},{"step":84,"content":"你注意到，刚刚一连串的问话中，墙上的仪器没有发出过哪怕一次警报。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1120301},{"step":85,"content":"这与环研究院的说法不太一样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1120301},{"step":86,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":87,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":88,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":89,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":90,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":91,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":92,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":81,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":93,"content":"你将更多资料摊开到帕加茜面前，其中几张照片上的景象显得尤为触目惊心。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1120301},{"step":94,"content":"被摧毁的巨大钢筋水泥建筑、破碎的混凝土块，以及爬满青藤宛如鬼域的破败城镇……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1120301},{"step":95,"content":"这就是马耶克镇，帕加茜的故乡。或者说，故乡的废墟。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1120301},{"step":96,"content":"帕加茜，这次审查，我还有一个非常重要的问题必须要搞清楚。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1120301},{"step":97,"content":"那就是马耶克镇毁灭的真相。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1120301},{"step":98,"content":"帕加茜低下了头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1120301},{"step":99,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"那是场事故。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1120301},{"step":100,"options":["人为的还是意外？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301089,"trial_step":89,"course":3,"drawing":1120301,"choices":[{"text":"人为的还是意外？","goto":90}]},{"step":101,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"两者都有。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1120301},{"step":102,"content":"能详细讲讲吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1120301},{"step":103,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"……马耶克镇的核电站，从我记事起，就已经接近极限了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1120301},{"step":104,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我们一直勉力维持着它的运转，却不能阻止它老化，变得越来越危险。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1120301},{"step":105,"content":"没有别的选择吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1120301},{"step":106,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"马耶克镇在这片大陆的最北端，一年有六个月是冬天。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1120301},{"step":107,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"没有核电站提供能源，我们支撑不下去。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1120301},{"step":108,"options":["你们可以离开马耶克镇"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"drawing":1120301,"choices":[{"text":"你们可以离开马耶克镇","goto":98}]},{"step":109,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"许多人这样做了，包括我的父母。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1120302},{"step":110,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"他们去了南方，去了不用担心寒冷与饥饿的梦想之城……他们抛弃了我们。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1120301},{"step":111,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"可总有人想要留下。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1120301},{"step":112,"content":"帕加茜昂起头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1120301},{"step":113,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我们知道，核武器有摧毁世界的力量，也知道核电站的事故风险。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1120301},{"step":114,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"但我们想在故土生活下去，我们没得选。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1120301},{"step":115,"content":"可你们的小镇还是……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1120301},{"step":116,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"留下的人越来越少，到最后，甚至连电站日常运作的人手都凑不齐了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1120305},{"step":117,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"每个人肩上的工作都越来越多。很多人再也无法忍受下去。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1120305},{"step":118,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"事故发生前，镇上只剩下两个人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1120305},{"step":119,"content":"你和镇长朗伊尔？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1120301},{"step":120,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"是的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1120302},{"step":121,"content":"你刚刚说过，马耶克的毁灭有人为的因素。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1120301},{"step":122,"content":"如果不是你，那就是镇长朗伊尔做的？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1120301},{"step":123,"content":"帕加茜表情有些错愕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1120301},{"step":124,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"不……他只是……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1120305},{"step":125,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"是我的错。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1120305},{"step":126,"content":"面对帕加茜的遮掩，你越发确认了心中的猜测。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1120305},{"step":127,"content":"测试全屏类文本对演出效果的支持","style":14,"background":50409,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":128,"content":"转场…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":129,"content":"音效及语音…………………………………………………………………………","voice":["vo_cgplot_100002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":130,"content":"一次性特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":131,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":132,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":116,"course":6,"drawing":1120301},{"step":133,"content":"入夜初期，或许是因为忌惮这种强大能源潜藏的威胁，人类曾经签署过一份核限制公约，禁止了包含核电站在内的一切核技术应用。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1120301},{"step":134,"content":"你应该知道这份公约的含义，帕加茜。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1120301},{"step":135,"content":"帕加茜没有回应，只是抿紧了嘴唇。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1120301},{"step":136,"content":"我需要的只是一个真相，一个你能安然待在管理局不被人恐惧的理由……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1120301},{"step":137,"content":"无论你在马耶克经历了什么，那都已经过去了。马耶克已经不存在了，再没有什么东西需要你维护了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1120301},{"step":138,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"不是这样！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1120304},{"step":139,"content":"帕加茜的声音骤然抬高。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1120304},{"step":140,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我还活着，马耶克还没有消失！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1120304},{"step":141,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"那是朗伊尔的心血，是我们的家……我被遗弃的时候，是他们收留了我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1120304},{"step":142,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"可我却没能救他……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1120305},{"step":143,"content":"帕加茜抬起头，眼中已满是泪水。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1120305},{"step":144,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"我抛弃了他，抛弃了马耶克……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1120305},{"step":145,"content":"颤抖着说完这一切，帕加茜低下头。经历了如此大的情绪波动，你下意识看了一眼墙上的监测仪器。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1120305},{"step":146,"content":"出乎意料的是，仪器上的数字平静得如同深秋的湖面。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1120305},{"step":147,"options":["安慰帕加茜"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301131,"trial_step":131,"course":3,"drawing":1120305,"choices":[{"text":"安慰帕加茜","goto":132}]},{"step":148,"content":"看着面前哭泣的少女，你不禁伸出了手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1120305},{"step":149,"content":"帕加茜……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1120305},{"step":150,"content":"别担心，管理局是你新的容身之所，我们不会抛弃你，更不会用你做实验……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1120305},{"step":151,"content":"如果你愿意的话，可以把这里当做……家。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1120305},{"step":152,"content":"你努力安慰着她，可说出的话却极其苍白。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1120305},{"step":153,"speaker":"帕加茜","content":"马耶克和朗伊尔消失的那个冬天，我就没有家了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1120305},{"step":154,"content":"帕加茜的声音冰冷又抗拒。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1120305},{"step":155,"content":"面对眼前悲伤的少女，此时此刻任何安慰的话语都显得那么多余。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1120305},{"step":156,"content":"或许，你该让她一个人待一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220301140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1120305}]}